OL,3,AHundreds remember synagogue attack
OL,4,Avictims
OL,5,
OL,6,FPrior to the event, Rabbi Daniel Walker
OL,7,Fsaid the Jewish community feels less
OL,8,Fsafe now than it did immediately after
OL,9,Fthe attack.
OL,23,APub: 31-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG6/39
