OL,3,A'She slipped out of my hand' - children
OL,4,Amissing after ferry sinks off northern
OL,5,ACyprus
OL,6,
OL,7,FShe and her husband Hayri survived, and
OL,8,Flike many other families are waiting
OL,9,Ffor news of their loved ones back in
OL,10,Fport as rescuers continue to search.
OL,12,F"She was saying, 'Don't let go'. And I
OL,13,Fdidn't let go of my daughter. I swear,
OL,14,FI didn't let her go," Bicer told
OL,15,Freporters through tears.
OL,23,APub: 31-AugQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/39
